      "Label pour {k} :": "Label for {k}:",
      "Message ({CALL}=correspondant · {MYCALL}=toi · {RST_SENT}/{RST_RCVD}/{NR}) :": "Message ({CALL}=other station · {MYCALL}=you · {RST_SENT}/{RST_RCVD}/{NR}):",
      "Copie manuelle (Ctrl+C) :": "Copy manually (Ctrl+C):",
